=== CANTILEVER 3D PRINTER DESIGN ===
Project: Mechanical Design / Rapid Prototyping
Course & Section: Computer Engineering – COE3A

1. DESIGN CONCEPT:
   - Cantilever style: Single vertical beam supports X-axis gantry
   - Compact footprint, simple frame, easy assembly
   - Build volume: Approx. 200 x 200 x 200 mm

2. MAIN COMPONENTS:
   - Frame: Aluminum extrusion / Acrylic
   - Motion: NEMA 17 stepper motors, belts & pulleys
   - Extruder: MK8 style
   - Electronics: Arduino + RAMPS board

3. KEY FEATURES:
   - Open design for easy access
   - Lightweight structure
   - Suitable for education and small projects
